# verify-report.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Auditable process: results shown per dimension
- Conclusions with evidence
- Takes effect only after user confirmation

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Verify report

### H2 (required)
- Target & trigger
- Dimension check table: dimension / process / result
- Evidence list: conclusion / evidence / non-evidence

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Issue list table: issue / confirmed / fix / impact recheck
- [optional] User confirmation record: item / date
